t_multiline, single_line, partial_last_line, empty_stdin, custom_format_iso, custom_format_time, custom_format_T, subsecond_S/s/T, incremental_default, incremental_custom_format\n     - Needs new tests: -s mode default, -s custom format, -i -s mutual exclusivity error, empty stdin with -s\n     - TestSIGPIPE is a standalone test (should not be modified)\n\n   - **pkg/testutils/difftest.go** and **pkg/sys/sigpipe.go** (provided in project_context, read for reference only)\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No errors encountered yet — implementation has not started. Only file reads were completed.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Identified what exists in the current implementation vs. what needs to be added\n   - R3.3 (custom format override for -i): Already partially works via parseArgs logic where customFormat overrides defaults, but need to verify\n   - R3.4 (mutual exclusivity): Need to add -s flag parsing and check for both -i and -s being set\n   - R4.1 (-s mode): Need new branch in run() using `now.Sub(startTime)` instead of `now.Sub(prevTime)`\n   - R4.2 (default format for -s): Same as -i default (`%H:%M:%S` with TZ=GMT)\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - One massive user message containing the full task specification with: role, repository_files (enormous list), project_context (vision, architecture, specifications, roadmap, analysis, source_code, requirement_states), context (task ID 5649), execution_constitution, go_style_constitution, task description (required reading, files, requirements, design decisions, acceptance criteria), shared_protocols, package_contracts. The task says to implement srd004-ts R3.3, R3.4, R4.1, R4.2 in cmd/ts/main.go and cmd/ts/ts_test.go.\n   - Second user message: \"CRITICAL: Respond with TEXT ONLY. Do NOT call any tools.\" — requesting a summary of the conversation.\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Modify `cmd/ts/main.go` to implement R3.3, R3.4, R4.1, R4.2:\n     - Add `sinceStart bool` field to config struct\n     - Add `-s` flag handling in 